# Vectors of tests/data/sst68040_8k on which the fork deliberately does not
# follow the oracle: one name per line, grouped by ruling
# (oracle/fuzz/disputes/NOTES.md). `sst68040 --known` counts a listed vector
# that fails apart, and FAILS on one that passes or is missing: when a ruling
# is settled, its block leaves this file in the same change.

# D38 - --strict-ram only. An instruction ending on the last word of a page:
# the fork reads the word after it (irc lookahead) and sets the next page's
# descriptor U bit; the oracle translates that page only at the next step.
040 fault/identity/8k seed=607 #264
